From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:06:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: libertas: associate the wiphy with its parent device

Set the wiphy parent device so sysfs links and device namespace handling
follow the physical wireless device.

Original author was not recorded in the imported patch.
[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/marvell/libertas/cfg.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/marvell/libertas/cfg.c
@@ -2105,6 +2105,8 @@ struct wireless_dev *lbs_cfg_alloc(struc
 		goto err_wiphy_new;
 	}
 
+	set_wiphy_dev(wdev->wiphy, dev);
+
 	return wdev;
 
  err_wiphy_new:
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/marvell/libertas/main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/marvell/libertas/main.c
@@ -852,6 +852,7 @@ struct lbs_private *lbs_add_card(void *c
 		goto err_adapter;
 	}
 
+	dev_net_set(dev, wiphy_net(wdev->wiphy));
 	dev->ieee80211_ptr = wdev;
 	dev->ml_priv = priv;
 	SET_NETDEV_DEV(dev, dmdev);
